Crack Fractography bundles third-party components in its packaged builds:

  NumPy, SciPy, scikit-image, Pillow   BSD-3-Clause / HPND
  FastAPI, Starlette, uvicorn           MIT / BSD-3-Clause
  pywebview, pyobjc                     BSD-3-Clause / MIT
  CPython                               PSF License

analysis/_vendor/extended_features.py is a verbatim copy of a file from
sem-crack-detector (MIT, same author), kept as a copy so the app can measure with no
second checkout installed. See packaging/vendor.py for why, and how it is kept in step.

This repository contains NO micrograph data. The packaged app ships no images and no
measurements; it computes them on your machine, into your own data directory.
